\nx=\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta ,\\,y=1.\n$$\n\nThen, to find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ we use the rule\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{{y}^{′}(\\theta )}{{x}^{′}(\\theta )}.\n$$\n\nCalculating the necessary derivatives, we have\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(\\theta )=-{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta ,\\,{y}^{′}(\\theta )=0.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{0}{-{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta }=0.\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting into our formula for the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{\\frac{d}{d\\theta }(0)}{-{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{0}{-{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373196 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373197 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373196 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373198 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373196 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373199 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373196 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373200 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373196 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373201 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373196 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373196 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373196 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186373200 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373196 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "e5193249-041d-5258-8bb5-af201644a8df" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373197 #edb/ref 1080 "{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta " #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373197 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373197 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "daef00ec-f0af-55f1-a147-630d2fa39a6d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373198 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{2}{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta " #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373198 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373198 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "bdba039a-b7e3-51de-b62c-a0a62757bb9a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373199 #edb/ref 1080 "{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta " #